---
description: >-
  A note stands on the left of a gateway, and a task sits on the gateway's left
  in the same row. The room for the note is reserved on the left, so the task
  is laid clear of it instead of under it.
---
bpmn-beta TB
  lane "Review"
    start s1 "Start"
    task before "Pre-check"
    xor gw "Approved?"
    note n1 "Needs a second signature"
    task after "Archive"
  s1 --> before
  s1 --> gw
  before --> after
  gw --> after
  n1 ... gw
